{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は京都にて個別握手会でしたヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！\nツアー終わった直後というのもあって直接感想とか聞けたりしてよかった！\n皆さんはいろんな所をちゃんとみててくれて嬉しい！\nコメントもそうだけど話を聞けるって事はこんなにいい事なんだと改めて実感しましたっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！\nまっちゅんお誕生日おめでとうございますヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなってごめんねぺろぺろ〜\nまっちゅんのキャラとかいつもいじってるけど、そんなまっちゅんが大好きぺろぺろ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺろぺろといったらかなりんですが、\n生駒は直接みんなのほっぺとかぺろぺろしてます。\nみんなのほっぺにちゅーするの大好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！\n握手会お留守番の皆さまお待たせしました！\nエアー握手会開催します！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒のリボンがお気に入り♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アースミュージック＆エコロジーのワンピースを着たよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！\n楽天スーパーセール始まっていますよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/02/1710760/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネ生駒すみません！\n半額のうちに沢山買うのだ！\nチャンス！チャンス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！\nへばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}